  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Realigning the Compass: Navigating Values in a Decade-Long Partnership between DSF &amp; ZINASU</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">With this partnership development project DSF and ZINASU aim to consolidate our partnership and develop new visions to pursue together as the partnership reaches its 10-year benchmark. The partnership development activity centres communication, re-aligning values and visions, as well as prioritising and formulating the new stepping stones for the partnership. The three objectives of the partnership development are to 1) build personal relationships and increase trust, 2) consolidate the partnership, and 3) develop the next phase of the partnership.</narrative>
  </description>
